The Student Learning Outcomes from Academic Advising at Qatar University are:
1. Students will demonstrate knowledge of QU academic policies and procedures;
2. Students will effectively utilize available technological resources at QU (such as Banner and Appointment
systems) for educational planning;
3. Students will demonstrate knowledge of academic and degree program requirements;
